B.a_S=s(["Teknolojinin e\u011fitimde hi\xe7bir fayda sa\u011flamad\u0131\u011f\u0131","\u0130nsanlar\u0131n art\u0131k kitap okumay\u0131 tamamen b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011f\u0131","Bilgiye ula\u015fman\u0131n ge\xe7mi\u015fte \xe7ok daha kolay oldu\u011fu","Ekran kullan\u0131m\u0131n\u0131n sadece fiziksel sa\u011fl\u0131\u011fa zarar verdi\u011fi"],t.s)
B.aai=new A.h7(["Teknoloji h\u0131zla ilerledik\xe7e insanlar\u0131n bilgiye ula\u015fma s\xfcresi k\u0131sal\u0131yor; ancak bilgiyi sindirme ve ele\u015ftirel s\xfczge\xe7ten ge\xe7irme becerisi ayn\u0131 oranda geli\u015fmiyor. Ekranlarda saniyeler i\xe7inde kayd\u0131r\u0131lan i\xe7erikler, derinlemesine d\xfc\u015f\xfcnme al\u0131\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 zay\u0131flat\u0131yor. Oysa kal\u0131c\u0131 \xf6\u011frenme, aceleyle t\xfcketilen verilerden de\u011fil, \xfczerinde sab\u0131rla d\xfc\u015f\xfcn\xfclen fikirlerden do\u011far.","Par\xe7an\u0131n ana d\xfc\u015f\xfcncesi nedir?","H\u0131zl\u0131 bilgi t\xfcketiminin derin d\xfc\u015f\xfcnme ve kal\u0131c\u0131 \xf6\u011frenmeyi olumsuz etkilemesi",B.a_S,"Metin, h\u0131zl\u0131 t\xfcketilen bilginin derin d\xfc\u015f\xfcnmeyi zay\u0131flatt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ve kal\u0131c\u0131 \xf6\u011frenmenin sab\u0131rl\u0131 d\xfc\u015f\xfcnme gerektirdi\u011fini vurgulamaktad\u0131r."])
B.YI=s(["Okurlar\u0131n sadece mutlu sonla biten romanlar\u0131 sevdi\u011fini","Tarihsel romanlar\u0131n di\u011fer t\xfcrlerden daha ger\xe7ek\xe7i oldu\u011funu","Kahramanlar\u0131n her zaman toplumun kurallar\u0131na uymas\u0131 gerekti\u011fini","Romanc\u0131n\u0131n kendi hayat\u0131n\u0131 oldu\u011fu gibi kitaba aktarmas\u0131 gerekti\u011fini"],t.s)
B.aak=new A.h7(["\u0130yi bir romanc\u0131, karakterlerini yaln\u0131zca kusursuz kahramanlar olarak \xe7izmez. \xc7\xfcnk\xfc ger\xe7ek ya\u015famda her insan\u0131n korkular\u0131, \xe7eli\u015fkileri ve zaaflar\u0131 vard\u0131r. Okur, kendisinden bir par\xe7a bulamad\u0131\u011f\u0131, hi\xe7 hata yapmayan tek boyutlu karakterlere inanmaz; ancak zaaflar\u0131yla y\xfczle\u015fen bir kahraman\u0131n \xf6yk\xfcs\xfcne kalbinden ba\u011flan\u0131r.","Yazar bu par\xe7ada a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dakilerden hangisini vurgulamaktad\u0131r?","\u0130nand\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 roman karakterlerinin insani zaaflara ve \xe7eli\u015fkilere sahip olmas\u0131 gerekti\u011fini",B.YI,"Par\xe7ada karakterlerin kusursuz de\u011fil, insani zaaflar\u0131 ve \xe7eli\u015fkileriyle ger\xe7ek\xe7i k\u0131l\u0131nd\u0131\u011f\u0131 anlat\u0131lmaktad\u0131r."])
B.Wy=s(["I numaral\u0131 c\xfcmle","II numaral\u0131 c\xfcmle","IV numaral\u0131 c\xfcmle","Par\xe7ada ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 bozan c\xfcmle yoktur"],t.s)
B.aad=new A.h7(["(I) Ba\u015far\u0131l\u0131 bir zaman y\xf6netimi, her i\u015fi ayn\u0131 anda yapmaya \xe7al\u0131\u015fmak de\u011fil, \xf6ncelikleri do\u011fru s\u0131ralamakt\u0131r. (II) \xd6nemli i\u015flerle acil i\u015fleri birbirinden ay\u0131ramayan ki\u015filer g\xfcn sonunda yorulur ama ilerleme kaydedemez. (III) Modern ofis binalar\u0131n\u0131n mimarisi \xe7al\u0131\u015fanlar\u0131n motivasyonunu art\u0131rmal\u0131d\u0131r. (IV) Bu y\xfczden g\xfcne ba\u015flamadan \xf6nce en y\xfcksek etkiyi yaratacak \xfc\xe7 temel hedef belirlemek verimlili\u011fi iki kat\u0131na \xe7\u0131kar\u0131r.","Bu par\xe7ada numaralanm\u0131\u015f c\xfcmlelerden hangisi d\xfc\u015f\xfcncenin ak\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 bozmaktad\u0131r?","III numaral\u0131 c\xfcmle",B.Wy,"Par\xe7a zaman y\xf6netimi ve \xf6ncelik s\u0131ralamas\u0131 \xfczerinedir; III. c\xfcmle ofis mimarisinden s\xf6z ederek ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 bozar."])
B.a_V=s(["Tan\u0131k g\xf6sterme","Say\u0131sal verilerden yararlanma","Benzetme","Ki\u015file\u015ftirme"],t.s)
B.aal=new A.h7(["Bilim tarihinde pek \xe7ok b\xfcy\xfck bulu\u015f, tesad\xfcfen bulunmu\u015f gibi g\xf6r\xfcnse de asl\u0131nda y\u0131llar s\xfcren haz\u0131rl\u0131kl\u0131 bir zihnin \xfcr\xfcn\xfcd\xfcr. Alexander Fleming'in penisilini ke\u015ffetmesi buna g\xfczel bir \xf6rnektir. Ba\u015fka bir g\xf6zlemci k\xfcflenen deney kab\u0131n\u0131 \xe7\xf6pe atabilirdi; ancak Fleming y\u0131llar\u0131n birikimiyle o k\xfcf\xfcn bakterileri yok etti\u011fini fark etti.","Bu par\xe7ada kullan\u0131lan d\xfc\u015f\xfcnceyi geli\u015ftirme yolu a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dakilerden hangisidir?","\xd6rneklendirme",B.a_V,"Yazar d\xfc\u015f\xfcncesini somutla\u015ft\u0131rmak i\xe7in Alexander Fleming'in penisilin ke\u015ffini \xf6rnek olarak vermi\u015ftir."])
B.a1e=s(["Bu y\xfczden herkes mutlaka g\xfcnde bir kitap bitirmelidir.","Sadece b\xfcy\xfck ad\u0131mlar atan insanlar tarihe ge\xe7ebilir.","\u0130stikrarl\u0131 \xe7al\u0131\u015fmak her zaman zaman kayb\u0131na yol a\xe7ar.","K\xfc\xe7\xfck hedefler koymak insan\u0131n hayallerini s\u0131n\u0131rlar."],t.s)
B.aab=new A.h7(["Ki\u015fisel geli\u015fim kitaplar\u0131 bize \xe7o\u011fu zaman b\xfcy\xfck s\u0131\xe7ramalar yapmay\u0131 \xf6\u011f\xfctler. ____ Oysa insan ya\u015fam\u0131ndaki kal\u0131c\u0131 d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfcmler, her g\xfcn aksat\u0131lmadan at\u0131lan k\xfc\xe7\xfcc\xfck ama istikrarl\u0131 ad\u0131mlarla ger\xe7ekle\u015fir.","Bu par\xe7ada bo\u015f b\u0131rak\u0131lan yere d\xfc\u015f\xfcncenin ak\u0131\u015f\u0131na g\xf6re a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dakilerden hangisi getirilmelidir?","Ancak ani ve b\xfcy\xfck de\u011fi\u015fimler \xe7o\u011fu zaman s\xfcrd\xfcr\xfclebilir olmaz.",B.a1e,'"Oysa..." diye devam eden sonraki c\xfcmleyle uyumlu olarak b\xfcy\xfck ad\u0131mlar\u0131n s\xfcrd\xfcr\xfclebilir olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131 belirtilmelidir.'])
B.a_h=s(["\xd6yk\xfcleme","Tart\u0131\u015fmac\u0131 anlat\u0131m i\xe7inde kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131rma","Say\u0131sal verilerle kan\u0131tlama","Mizahi anlat\u0131m"],t.s)
B.aaj=new A.h7(['Dil, bir milletin y\xfczy\u0131llar boyunca biriktirdi\u011fi k\xfclt\xfcr\xfcn, d\xfc\u015f\xfcncenin ve duygular\u0131n canl\u0131 ta\u015f\u0131y\u0131c\u0131s\u0131d\u0131r. Bir s\xf6zc\xfc\u011f\xfc kaybetti\u011finizde yaln\u0131zca bir sesi de\u011fil, o s\xf6zc\xfc\u011f\xfcn arkas\u0131ndaki ya\u015fam bi\xe7imini ve haf\u0131zay\u0131 da yitirirsiniz. \xdcnl\xfc d\xfc\u015f\xfcn\xfcr\xfcn dedi\u011fi gibi: "S\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131m dilimin s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131 kadard\u0131r."',"Bu par\xe7an\u0131n anlat\u0131m\u0131nda a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dakilerden hangisi vard\u0131r?","Tan\u0131k g\xf6sterme (Al\u0131nt\u0131 yapma)",B.a_h,"Par\xe7ada d\xfc\u015f\xfcn\xfcr\xfcn s\xf6z\xfc t\u0131rnak i\xe7inde do\u011frudan al\u0131nt\u0131lanarak tan\u0131k g\xf6sterme yap\u0131lm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r."])
